@startuml
title FE-04 Staff or Manager Human Review
actor Reviewer
participant DesignReviewController
participant HumanReviewService
database DesignRequestRepository
database HumanReviewDecisionRepository
Reviewer -> DesignReviewController : open NEED_REVIEW request
DesignReviewController -> HumanReviewService : load scoped request
HumanReviewService -> DesignRequestRepository : find current version
DesignRequestRepository --> HumanReviewService : request and snapshot
HumanReviewService --> DesignReviewController : safe review projection
Reviewer -> DesignReviewController : decision + mandatory explanation + version
DesignReviewController -> HumanReviewService : record decision
HumanReviewService -> DesignRequestRepository : check version and state
HumanReviewService -> HumanReviewDecisionRepository : append decision and audit
HumanReviewService -> DesignRequestRepository : update status
DesignReviewController --> Reviewer : decision result or 409 conflict
note over Reviewer
Staff and Manager may review within authority.
An explanation is mandatory; Admin cannot decide.
end note
@enduml
